---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Maitri Shah | Benchmarks"
  description="Engineering contributions to the European Cybersecurity & AI Hackathon Championship."
>
  <header class="card">
    <p class="kicker">Benchmarks</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">European Championship Engineering</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">
      This page focuses on the benchmark and infrastructure systems that participants rely on during competition execution.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="section card">
    <h2>Task Development & Support</h2>
    <p>
      I am part of the team designing and deploying tasks for the <strong>European Cybersecurity & AI Hackathon Championship</strong>,
      which reached over <span class="metric">200 participants</span> across <span class="metric">7 international venues</span>.
    </p>

    <p><strong>My Contributions</strong></p>
    <ul class="clean">
      <li><strong>Onboarding Automation:</strong> I developed scripts that participants use after cluster login. These scripts automate HuggingFace dataset downloads and full Python/Conda environment configuration so participants can start immediately.</li>
      <li><strong>Task Design:</strong> I developed tasks for image attribution and watermark detection, and tested them against naive hacks to prevent trivial bypasses.</li>
      <li><strong>24-Hour Live Support:</strong> I provided on-site support during 24-hour hackathon windows, including 16+ hours of real-time troubleshooting for environment conflicts and coding errors.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
